; Switch to performing and printing mode
;
; Sets ActionPerform ($B6FA) and RawOutputFlag ($B701) to 1. The first makes the
; handlers carry the command out and #R$72DD leave ActionAllowed alone; the
; second is the flag that makes the message printer take its second article
; table (see notes). Done before printing a question or an error message.
;
; O:A 1
@label=SetPerformMode
c$7D6B LD A,$01      ;
 $7D6D LD ($B6FA),A  ;
 $7D70 LD ($B701),A  ;
 $7D73 RET           ;
